    "description": "<h2 data-local-id=\"e25c59620799\">Goal</h2><p data-local-id=\"89b6897d8a30\">Show an Operator’s Partner Relationships directly on the Operator record, including the applicable billing details.</p><p data-local-id=\"abb8e3144cc1\">For <strong>Direct</strong> relationships, display billing values from the Operator. For all other relationships, display values from the Partner.</p><h2 data-local-id=\"d3466b9f69df\">Build</h2><h3 data-local-id=\"0ff46db7b78c\">1. Add display fields to <code>Operator_Partner_Relationship__c</code></h3><p data-local-id=\"f7d04d9d164d\">Create the following Formula (Text) fields:</p><table data-local-id=\"cea91b11-3558-4eb4-9598-b35bd659f4b0\"><thead><tr><th data-local-id=\"74c2b04c2f59\"><p data-local-id=\"39f2f5fa341d\">Display Field</p></th><th data-local-id=\"eefbef136fb2\"><p data-local-id=\"b146094d374d\">API Name</p></th><th data-local-id=\"497e64a86b47\"><p data-local-id=\"4857be327c35\">Logic</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-local-id=\"e58191a2dd49\"><p data-local-id=\"e3594b1d4501\">Partner Type</p></td><td data-local-id=\"d1e82a1b17d9\"><p data-local-id=\"25f901e8f774\"><code>Partner_Type_Display__c</code></p></td><td data-local-id=\"454d2c2697e6\"><p data-local-id=\"0e7843d1ddd7\">Direct = <code>&quot;Direct&quot;</code>; otherwise Partner Type</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"0b75f9b50859\"><p data-local-id=\"a299c4907a01\">Payment Terms</p></td><td data-local-id=\"142951b6acae\"><p data-local-id=\"403e0bd51e68\"><code>Payment_Terms_Display__c</code></p></td><td data-local-id=\"b4624b73190b\"><p data-local-id=\"0123ab6d4b98\">Direct = Operator value; otherwise Partner value</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"681f84f6ae30\"><p data-local-id=\"27c126a1a141\">Invoicing Cadence</p></td><td data-local-id=\"578aeddb2974\"><p data-local-id=\"445daea75a4a\"><code>Invoicing_Cadence_Display__c</code></p></td><td data-local-id=\"97a563c1979d\"><p data-local-id=\"3320603f2773\">Direct = Operator value; otherwise Partner value</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"ebabebacc5c9\"><p data-local-id=\"700777de8b4a\">Currency</p></td><td data-local-id=\"19fb819f25cf\"><p data-local-id=\"4fe0fa298601\"><code>Invoicing_Currency_Display__c</code></p></td><td data-local-id=\"474a1c06ad24\"><p data-local-id=\"6179819fadc0\">Direct = Operator value; otherwise Partner value</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"2048f7f1368b\"><p data-local-id=\"9c1362613a3f\">AP Contact</p></td><td data-local-id=\"ea35352f509d\"><p data-local-id=\"615b7ec7e9ed\"><code>AP_Contact_Display__c</code></p></td><td data-local-id=\"8ee9c1edd157\"><p data-local-id=\"ceafb82ed30f\">Direct = Operator Billing Contact; otherwise Partner Billing Contact</p></td></tr><tr><td data-local-id=\"8396d497bf14\"><p data-local-id=\"ffaae4088923\">PO Required</p></td><td data-local-id=\"6cb563fc87bd\"><p data-local-id=\"3af2a22ba35b\"><code>PO_Required_Display__c</code></p></td><td data-local-id=\"ee4defa30443\"><p data-local-id=\"af96602dc041\">Direct = Operator value; otherwise Partner value; display <code>Yes</code> / <code>No</code></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-local-id=\"c1e410cc50f8\">Use the same pattern for each field: if <code>Is_Direct__c = TRUE</code>, read from the Operator; otherwise read from the Partner.</p><p data-local-id=\"1d0d61e575bd\"><strong>Example — Payment Terms:</strong></p><pre data-local-id=\"57170685-8c4b-46af-a054-ee1efd3427f3\" data-wrap=\"true\"><code>IF(\n    Is_Direct__c,\n    TEXT(Operator__r.Payment_Terms__c),\n    TEXT(Partner__r.Payment_Terms__c)\n)</code></pre><p data-local-id=\"00c1cd45e6d2\">These fields are display-only and should always reflect the current Operator/Partner values.</p><h3 data-local-id=\"44b6729fdb38\">2. Add Partner Relationships list to Operator</h3><p data-local-id=\"6bcbbd3917c1\">Add a <strong>Dynamic Related List – Single</strong> to the Operator Lightning page.</p><p data-local-id=\"00d7994b3f6e\"><strong>List name:</strong> Partner Relationships</p><p data-local-id=\"bf9d22c3751e\"><strong>Columns:</strong></p><ol data-local-id=\"8da0e6882d86\"><li data-local-id=\"1cc54421438e\"><p data-local-id=\"f5798531c294\">Partner</p></li><li data-local-id=\"9419c63ac6ba\"><p data-local-id=\"151bb690508d\">Partner Type</p></li><li data-local-id=\"a0d6ee2c16cb\"><p data-local-id=\"95d59ae5d343\">Payment Terms</p></li><li data-local-id=\"c5f4335724a0\"><p data-local-id=\"103eb78c4d13\">Invoicing Cadence</p></li><li data-local-id=\"3a3f62cd20fd\"><p data-local-id=\"194489af8ed1\">Currency</p></li><li data-local-id=\"bee6709aad7e\"><p data-local-id=\"319465ea9413\">AP Contact</p></li><li data-local-id=\"677354997191\"><p data-local-id=\"d93f479e73a0\">PO Req.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"6ce00463a85c\"><p data-local-id=\"afcd95b3b231\">Deals</p></li></ol><p data-local-id=\"2e87f7c87f59\">Additional configuration:</p><ul data-local-id=\"705101578076\"><li data-local-id=\"3c055b0578bc\"><p data-local-id=\"43170cd11b1f\">Use <code>Partner__c</code> for the Partner column so users can open the Partner record.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"e9155e1bcabc\"><p data-local-id=\"4a130ed7d12d\">Use existing <code>Active_Deals__c</code> for Deals.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"96fce142a8e1\"><p data-local-id=\"069565876f31\">Do <strong>not</strong> include the Relationship Name field.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"d2ad57e2dce9\"><p data-local-id=\"76f8ef1e889e\">Sort by Partner ascending.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"3112e4fd4509\"><p data-local-id=\"80083306b65f\">Remove <strong>New</strong> and other create actions. Relationships are managed by WAGR-384 automation.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"1c30990b8d91\"><p data-local-id=\"f92ee0f2ac3b\">Include both Active and Inactive relationships.</p></li></ul><h2 data-local-id=\"26d144255253\">Acceptance Criteria</h2><ol data-local-id=\"419c2b833663\"><li data-local-id=\"2ced4acb71fe\"><p data-local-id=\"110b10f1dafc\">Direct relationships display billing values from the Operator.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"173a7f81fd18\"><p data-local-id=\"7ccdc60ff882\">Partner relationships display billing values from the Partner.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"9de193068a83\"><p data-local-id=\"4ba2b0c1e34a\">Direct relationships show <strong>Direct</strong> as Partner Type.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"ad6dec213294\"><p data-local-id=\"7ab6dab8e791\">Clicking Partner opens the Partner record.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"7fb73748c763\"><p data-local-id=\"392f6ed0c7e9\">The related list does not allow users to create relationship records.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"b08d96bfdc09\"><p data-local-id=\"d229ec06cba4\">Changes to Operator/Partner billing values automatically appear in the list.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"c66c9855793b\"><p data-local-id=\"a2641d3f611c\">Inactive relationships remain visible.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"c7349f445308\"><p data-local-id=\"0066ec84f769\">Missing billing values display as blank without errors.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"8e7eab0746ae\"><p data-local-id=\"02e5f0670dea\">The Operator highlights panel field that counts related Partners is retitled <strong>Active Partners</strong>.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"78509e0c7655\"><p data-local-id=\"f52bd083acb4\">Active Partners counts only Partners with an <strong>Active</strong> relationship and at least one active deal with the Operator. Inactive relationships are not counted.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"b0173c57c4aa\"><p data-local-id=\"77b9b0f526ef\">The count updates automatically when a relationship or deal status changes.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"e2d2e7f2bf9b\"><p data-local-id=\"76aa506a8464\">The <strong>Partner Relationships</strong> related list still shows Active and Inactive relationships (see AC #7). Only the count is active-only.</p></li></ol><h2 data-local-id=\"4421819dcce3\">Notes</h2><ul data-local-id=\"e73d26bc34cb\"><li data-local-id=\"7f9592264c7b\"><p data-local-id=\"06efba80c091\">Direct-row Currency depends on WAGR-385 adding <code>Invoicing_Currency__c</code> back to the Operator. <span data-local-id=\"76562154-339d-406f-88d2-a1bf519d2545\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d\">@Taryn Reithofer</span> can you confirm if there was a reason for not having Invoicing Currency for Operators for Direct Deals? </p></li><li data-local-id=\"af54c79cf595\"><p data-local-id=\"b47c2750d69f\">Deals represents <strong>Active Deals</strong> only via <code>Active_Deals__c</code>.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"35b39561b176\"><p data-local-id=\"a68141bda09a\">Partner-side related list is covered separately by WAGR-364. <span data-local-id=\"5c22e9ba-54ac-4374-8702-5c5fe8c2df63\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:e303283b-a074-400e-9470-8d704ea7427d\">@Taryn Reithofer</span> can you re-write the requirements for <a href=\"https://jumpr.atlassian.net/browse/WAGR-364\" data-card-appearance=\"inline\">https://jumpr.atlassian.net/browse/WAGR-364</a> to match what’s in the mockup for what the Partner page should show for the related Operator page? It should be driven from the junction object Cedrick created as part of this epic. </p></li></ul>",
