          "body": "<p data-local-id=\"3b535d3141b3\"><span data-local-id=\"68f7b327-53f5-442a-9aba-1fd20e06b501\" data-type=\"mention\" data-user-id=\"712020:61966a85-61f2-42ce-8382-85568cc7e090\">@Kobi Kunasekaran</span> <br><br>I noticed that Invoicing Currency and Payment Terms are currently missing from the Operator layout, whereas they&#039;re visible on the Partner page. Since these fields are referenced in formula fields, I recommend exposing them on the Operator layout as well for UI consistency. Let me know if you&#039;d like me to add them.<br><br><strong>Operator Lightning Page:</strong></p><figure data-local-id=\"f0c262839e40\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"566\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"f06fe9b8-a260-43e7-8c6d-907a2bee0501\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-19 at 1.00.30 AM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><p data-local-id=\"17dddffa9e04\"></p><p data-local-id=\"42e26340dbe7\"><strong>Partner Lightning Page:</strong></p><figure data-local-id=\"cda7f6b43a67\" data-type=\"media-single\" data-layout=\"align-start\" data-width=\"551\" data-width-type=\"pixel\"><div data-type=\"media\" data-media-type=\"file\" data-id=\"cdb345d4-29b2-43d6-9241-0bc157ea617a\" data-alt=\"Screenshot 2026-09-19 at 1.00.52 AM.png\" data-width=\"1600\" data-height=\"783\"></div></figure><p data-local-id=\"068686c33910\"><br></p>",
